[00:01.25]Lovingly Jehovah
[00:04.14]Made provision through his Son
[00:10.19]For our sins to be forgiven
[00:15.44]And for death to be undone.
[00:21.98]If we truly are repentant,
[00:26.66]His forgiveness we can claim
[00:31.48]On the basis of Christ’s ransom,
[00:38.50]Asking pardon in his name.
[00:45.27]We receive such mercy
[00:51.36]When we act like God above
[00:57.92]And forgive each other freely,
[01:02.90]Showing empathy and love.
[01:09.32]Putting up with one another,
[01:13.68]Putting hurtfulness away;
[01:20.16]Showing honor to our brother,
[01:25.64]Showing love’s surpassing way.
[01:35.80]Mercy is a virtue
[01:38.82]That we all should cultivate.
[01:45.78]It will keep us from resentment,
[01:50.66]From the bitterness of hate.
[01:57.56]When we imitate Jehovah,
[02:01.79]Who is unsurpassed in love,
[02:09.08]We will truly be forgiving;
[02:15.00]We will be like God above.
